{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1000_012mam", "source_sha256": "ea69b4a26356dc7f1697abefcfc3aeba7532bf5461704d5c1035ed7f85231df1", "ja": "うう……兄ちゃん、どうしよう……\n真美、大変なことになっちゃったよ……。", "zh": "呜呜……大哥哥，怎么办……\n真美现在遇到大问题了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e3710233d6574581dc179e3c9c2ae9382c131d078cb0e3380c93dc8b60fb32f3", "ja": "本番中にどうしたんだ、真美。\nなにかハプニングでもあったのか！？", "zh": "怎么啦，真美？现在是正式演出，\n该不会发生什么意外了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "0465c71c90cac24e53a98cae82c5b4bd68b2694b0f708e9903ab65a1445778c2", "ja": "実はね、真美、緊張しちゃってステージ前に\n何も食べられなくて、立ってるのもやっとなんだ……。", "zh": "是这样的，真美太紧张了，\n表演开始前什么都吃不下，现在都快站不稳了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a4f0055d151bfc5a46cfc76644bb516748e06b6defe7d77786500f61ba67e9ad", "ja": "元気そうにふるまってたのに、そうだったのか……。\n真美、何か食べるか？", "zh": "我看你在台上很有活力，原来是在逞强吗……\n真美，你想吃什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "35e01e3e4166bb0aa005670db7287c9fbefe6bd46f1ef54014da1037f764b4dc", "ja": "兄ちゃん……『出張！　佐竹飯店』で、あんまんと\nにくまんとギョーザ、売り切れる前に買ってきて……！", "zh": "大哥哥……趁被抢光之前，去『快闪店！佐竹饭店』\n帮真美买豆沙包、肉包还有煎饺……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "dc9dff380315edc618f7c5c9fbb10ad0d7f9bc0d0c762d4f7c60af5fee2d4644", "ja": "それがないと、真美は、真美はもう……。", "zh": "要是买不到，真美就、真美就要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a53f4a7728c6e82e9d5b57322c64f2ed76af8b30f3be1fdb054d6f22e2ff62f3", "ja": "わ、わかった。でも真美、もうすぐ出番だろ？\n交代するまでもちそうか？", "zh": "我、我知道了。可是真美，你就快要上场了吧？\n有办法撑到下一个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "3d59902de78c8b8e6e5eacac0c9accd5eadcda395330b6409dfb0499316e84e8", "ja": "うん！　真美、がんばる！\n兄ちゃん、待ってるからね……！", "zh": "嗯！真美会努力的！\n大哥哥，真美等你回来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "8ad15ff5bf421c3e2a974fb6b8dea42be0e7a8f5aefcebbdddd1345cf036f7a2", "ja": "ふぅ、お腹いっぱい、ぽんぽこりん～！　どうしても\n食べたかったんだよねーコレ。ありがと、兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "呼，吃得好饱，肚子好撑～！\n真美一直都很想吃这些东西。谢啦，大哥哥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fedbf4bae909b54e13b6178bdab5201ec318367e872eff985d2fb5b13cf1514f", "ja": "……真美。本当は食べたかっただけか？\nお腹がすいて倒れそうって話だったよな？", "zh": "……真美，其实你只是想吃这些东西而已吧？\n刚刚不是说快要饿昏了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "75871727a57bf8127a2938f71f65a803200258801c400260217810e1cbc98a2c", "ja": "はっ、そういう設定だった！　ええと、これで元気、\nもりもりじゃよ……。ありがとうなぁ、旅の人……。", "zh": "啊！都忘了这个设定！呃呃，\n真美现在恢复活力了……谢谢你啊，好心的旅人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "e30798a9846e1f469c09113a8a28b49b0dc13e00fac85e66760934bd14c7b951", "ja": "てことで！　いっちょ真美の満腹パワーで、\nメッチャ盛り上げてくよ～！", "zh": "就是这样！\n真美要靠着吃饱的力量去嗨翻全场啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "271cb66d02eecb1a76fae988cc531d0f88d0a02d789a67c6a590972b533c6495", "ja": "って、ダメだー！！", "zh": "不对，不行啦──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b8783d532fa11571bf71752ab8a98b96a74c455d0e7c5a9cbb59107ff3b895ca", "ja": "は？　こ、今度はどうしたんだ？", "zh": "什么？现、现在又怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "368d87a4a0857cc0df18808f23534830d4ce90c14a12d02143b61257c03d95a4", "ja": "こんなにお腹いっぱいにしちゃったら、宇宙遊泳の\nワイヤーについてるベルト、締まんないかも……。", "zh": "真美现在吃得太饱，这样待会太空漫步时\n吊钢丝的腰带可能会绑不起来耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "3ba2dd1b4691ddb8ed6901e5396205489a10e2cc7782ec3e8c79ec9672e0c61f", "ja": "うあうあ～！　真美、飛べないの！？\nこのみんにおこられるかもー！", "zh": "呜啊呜啊～！真美会飞不起来吗！？\n要被木木骂啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4281defd7b4742efa3f4811f61f8285957952a82c011474ba513b1bfa08c52f4", "ja": "落ち着け、真美！　今からいっぱいステージで\n動いて、エネルギーを消費するんだ。それしかない！", "zh": "冷静点，真美！只要接下来在舞台上拚命活动，\n就能燃烧热量了。现在只能这么做了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "cd038a7c9a1bfda34b03099794a7b6af682f0ae561e7359b4576cda95a929f16", "ja": "うん！　見てて兄ちゃん、真美、\n10分でちょい痩せしてくるから！　グッドラック！", "zh": "好！大哥哥，你看着吧，\n真美去花个10分钟小瘦一下！祝你好运！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0033_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c335b6cd1d948cd90ff3a8e8aba80de503507e4019b8b11544ad27e75728da53", "ja": "ああ、グッドラックが必要なのは真美だけどな！\n俺はサウナスーツでも探してくる！　グッドラック！", "zh": "很好，不过需要好运的是真美自己！\n我去帮你找件发汗衣！祝你好运！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
